1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,020
Here is the same reaction on an energy diagram.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:06,953
Reactants on the left, products on the right, lower in energy.

3
00:00:06,953 --> 00:00:10,325
There is a single hump, because there is a single step.

4
00:00:10,325 --> 00:00:17,929
At the very top sits the transition state, with the oxygen and the iodine each half bonded to the same carbon.

5
00:00:17,929 --> 00:00:21,835
No intermediate, nowhere for the reaction to pause.

